nce with their singing.", "bn": "তারা তাদের গান দিয়ে শ্রোতাদের মুগ্ধ করল।", "fa": "با آوازشان شنوندگان را مجذوب کردند.", "fr": "Ils ont charmé le public par leur chant.", "id": "Mereka memikat penonton dengan nyanyian mereka.", "tr": "Şarkılarıyla dinleyicileri büyülediler.", "ur": "انہوں نے اپنے گانے سے عوام کو مسحور کر دیا۔"}, "independentlyReviewed": true, "words": [{"arabic": "فَتَنُوا", "target": true, "translation": {"bs": "očarali su", "en": "they charmed", "bn": "তারা মুগ্ধ করল", "fa": "مجذوب کردند", "fr": "ont charmé", "id": "mereka memikat", "tr": "büyülediler", "ur": "انہوں نے مسحور کیا"}}, {"arabic": "الْجُمْهُورَ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "publiku", "en": "the public", "bn": "জনতা", "fa": "جمع", "fr": "le public", "id": "penonton", "tr": "halk, dinleyiciler", "ur": "عوام"}}, {"arabic": "بِغِنَائِهِمْ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "svojim pjevanjem", "en": "with their singing", "bn": "তাদের গানে", "fa": "با آواز خود", "fr": "par leur chant", "id": "dengan nyanyian mereka", "tr": "şarkılarıyla", "ur": "اپنے گانے سے"}}]}, {"arabic": "فَتَنَّا الْأَطْفَالَ بِالْقِصَصِ", "spoken": "audio/889427a268659642ce6d.m4a", "tense": "past", "pronoun": "nahnu", "translation": {"bs": "Očarali smo djecu pričama.", "en": "We charmed the children with stories.", "bn": "আমরা গল্প দিয়ে শিশুদের মুগ্ধ করলাম।", "fa": "با قصه‌ها بچه‌ها را مجذوب کردیم.", "fr": "Nous avons charmé les enfants par des histoires.", "id": "Kami memikat anak-anak dengan cerita.", "tr": "Çocukları hikâyelerle büyüledik.", "ur": "ہم نے کہانیوں سے بچوں کو مسحور کر دیا۔"}, "independentlyReviewed": true, "words": [{"arabic": "فَتَنَّا", "target": true, "translation": {"bs": "očarali smo", "en": "we charmed", "bn": "আমরা মুগ্ধ করলাম", "fa": "مجذوب کردیم", "fr": "nous avons charmé", "id": "kami memikat", "tr": "büyüledik", "ur": "ہم نے مسحور کیا"}}, {"arabic": "الْأَطْفَالَ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "djecu", "en": "the children", "bn": "শিশুরা", "fa": "کودکان", "fr":